  "is_prerecorded": false,
  "description": "This week on Convergence Zone, I’m excited to play new music I’m loving from artists like Yaeji, Eydís Evenson, Deborah Martin & Jill Haley, Bluetech, Siren and the Sea — and debuting a single from the upcoming self-titled debut LP by The Conspiracy Tapes\n\nAwesome local music from AeTopus, Dreamstate Logic, MIDI Janitor, Mt Fog, and Style.King.Of.The.Week\n\nAnd remembering the great Dave Smith, creator of the celebrated Prophet synthesizers — with music by dedicated players of his gear such as Betamaxx with FM Attack, CHVRCHES, and Shannon Hammett of LEATHERS and ACTORS",
